sts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":65043088,"digest":"sha256:31f91c9e5f747f3f575cc40ed91ab1eb02a3d5f1b71e2c3b1170ccd1c96b07ba","download_count":12,"created_at":"2026-06-10T14:29:26Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T09:07:54Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.25.0/secretnetwork_1.25.0_NOSGX_mainnet_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-22.04.deb"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/assets/443634416","id":443634416,"node_id":"RA_kwDODh_DHs4acVLw","name":"secretnetwork_1.25.0_testnet_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-22.04.deb","label":null,"uploader":{"login":"valdok","id":9623498,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2MjM0OTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9623498?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok","html_url":"https://github.com/valdok","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":65162342,"digest":"sha256:80e6644fed73c4070852932bcb4fb40e1a0ee9689795b7c1b44e6ced3c635a6f","download_count":15,"created_at":"2026-06-10T11:08:03Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T11:08:22Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.25.0/secretnetwork_1.25.0_testnet_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-22.04.deb"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/tarball/v1.25.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/zipball/v1.25.0","body":"## What's Changed\r\n\r\nThe following key functionality was added:\r\n\r\n1. Node operators now can replace their MachineIDs by running a dedicated transaction (docs [here](https://docs.scrt.network/secret-network-documentation/infrastructure/running-a-node-validator/replacing-an-existing-machineid))\r\n2. Support for Non-SGX Nodes. It is now possible to run Secret Network nodes non non-SGX hardware. Such nodes will require pairing to an existing SGX node. This functionality is still in Beta stage. Docs [here](https://docs.scrt.network/secret-network-documentation/infrastructure/running-a-node-validator/non-sgx-node-beta).\r\n3. Updated emergency validator list\r\n4. Support for ProofOfCloud-validated machines\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/compare/v1.24.1...v1.25.0\r\n\r\n# Upgrade instructions (mainnet)\r\n\r\n## 1. Download check-hw tool, extract and run the upgrade script\r\n```\r\nwget https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.25.0/check_hw_1.25.0_ubuntu-22.04.tar.gz\r\ntar -xzvf check_hw_1.25.0_ubuntu-22.04.tar.gz\r\ncd check-hw\r\n./upgrade_script_1.25_mainnet.sh\r\ncd ..\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nMake sure the upgrade script runs successfully. At the end you should see this message:\r\n```\r\nUpgrade script completed successfully\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 2. Download and install the new node\r\n```\r\nwget https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.25.0/secretnetwork_1.25.0_mainnet_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-22.04.deb\r\nsudo apt install -y \"./secretnetwork_1.25.0_mainnet_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-22.04.deb\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 3. Start the new node\r\n```\r\n# re-apply any systemd unit file customizations\r\n\r\n# Restart the node\r\nsudo systemctl restart secret-node\r\njournalctl -fu secret-node\r\n```\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/303438621","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/303438621/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/303438621/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/tag/v1.24.1","id":303438621,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODh_DHs4SFhsd","tag_name