station.rs#L283\r\n* Enable Cron \r\n* Multiple machines can be added via Governance proposal\r\n* Removed MRSIGNER requirement\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/compare/v1.23.2...v1.24.0\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n# Upgrade instructions (testnet)\r\n\r\n## 1. Download check-hw tool, extract and run the upgrade script\r\n```\r\nwget https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.24.0/check_hw_1.24.0_ubuntu-22.04.tar.gz\r\ntar -xzvf check_hw_1.24.0_ubuntu-22.04.tar.gz\r\ncd check-hw\r\n./upgrade_script_1.24_testnet.sh\r\ncd ..\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nMake sure the upgrade script runs successfully. At the end you should see this message:\r\n```\r\nUpgrade script completed successfully\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 2. Download and install the new node\r\n```\r\nwget https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.24.0/secretnetwork_1.24.0_testnet_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-22.04.deb\r\nsudo apt install -y \"./secretnetwork_1.24.0_testnet_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-22.04.deb\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 3. Start the new node\r\n```\r\n# re-apply any systemd unit file customizations\r\n\r\n# Restart the node\r\nsudo systemctl restart secret-node\r\njournalctl -fu secret-node\r\n```\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/277648524","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/277648524/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/277648524/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/tag/v1.23.3","id":277648524,"author":{"login":"valdok","id":9623498,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2MjM0OTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9623498?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok","html_url":"https://github.com/valdok","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valdok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https