.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/zipball/v1.18.0","body":"### What's new\r\n\r\n1. Migration to MRENCLAVE Sealing\r\n- Support for new gov upgrade proposal \r\n- Support for Emergency Upgrade \r\n2. Setting hard-coded admin for certain contracts (by Shade request)\r\n3. Added code hashes of 5, 877 and 563 SNIP contracts to the list of allowed code hashes to make it possible to upgrade SNIP contracts without breaking existing code.\r\n4. Allow plaintext messages in contract Init function (by Euclid request)\r\n5. Removed crisis module\r\n6. Added circuit breaker module\r\n\r\n## Upgrade instructions \r\nhttps://github.com/SecretFoundation/docs/blob/gitbook/infrastructure/resources/upgrade-instructions/v1.18.md\r\n\r\n\r\n## Changelog\r\n* Draft: MRENCLAVE support antehandler by @cboh4 in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1676\r\n* allow-plaintext-msg-in-init-function by @cboh4 in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1700\r\n* Fix hash validation, update allowed code hashes list by @cboh4 in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1702\r\n* add 2 contracts for testing snip20 6dec upgrade on testnet by @cboh4 in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1705\r\n* Secret v1.18 shade update hardcoded admins by @cboh4 in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1708\r\n* Secret 1.18 by @valdok in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1709\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/compare/v1.17.1...v1.18.0","mentions_count":2},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/211326832","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/211326832/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/211326832/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/tag/v1.18.2-beta.6","id":211326832,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI="