0Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.15.0-beta.18/secretnetwork_1.15.0-beta.18_testnet_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-22.04.deb"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/tarball/v1.15.0-beta.18","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/zipball/v1.15.0-beta.18","body":"# :warning: TESTNET :warning:\r\n\r\n### What's Changed\r\n- Make txhash in env uppercase by @blake-regalia in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1688\r\n- Add missing consensus module CLI commands\r\n- Add parameters for compute module: max contract size and compile cost\r\n- Fix wasm snapshotter\r\n\r\n## Upgrade instructions (Ubuntu-22.04)\r\n```bash\r\n# Backup any systemd unit file customizations\r\n\r\nwget \"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.15.0-beta.18/secretnetwork_1.15.0-beta.18_testnet_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-22.04.deb\"\r\n\r\nsudo systemctl stop secret-node\r\n\r\nsudo apt install -y \"./secretnetwork_1.15.0-beta.18_testnet_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-22.04.deb\"\r\n\r\n# re-apply any systemd unit file customizations\r\n\r\n# Restart the node\r\nsudo systemctl restart secret-node\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Upgrade instructions (Ubuntu-20.04)\r\n```bash\r\n# Backup any systemd unit file customizations\r\n\r\nwget \"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.15.0-beta.18/secretnetwork_1.15.0-beta.18_testnet_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-20.04.deb\"\r\n\r\nsudo systemctl stop secret-node\r\n\r\nsudo apt install -y \"./secretnetwork_1.15.0-beta.18_testnet_goleveldb_amd64_ubuntu-20.04.deb\"\r\n\r\n# re-apply any systemd unit file customizations\r\n\r\n# Restart the node\r\nsudo systemctl restart secret-node\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/compare/v1.15.0-beta.15...v1.15.0-beta.18","mentions_count":1},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/185395025","assets_url":"https://api.github.com