://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/zipball/v1.12.0-beta.8","body":"# ⚠️ TESTNET ⚠️\r\n## Upgrade instructions\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Backup your node's SGX secrets\r\ncp -a /opt/secret/.sgx_secrets ~/sgx_secrets_backup\r\nmkdir 111-beta.18backup\r\ncp ~/.secretd/.node/* 111-beta.18backup/\r\n\r\nwget \"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.12.0-beta.8/secretnetwork_1.12.0-beta.8_testnet_goleveldb_amd64.deb\"\r\n\r\nsudo systemctl stop secret-node\r\n\r\nsudo apt install -y \"./secretnetwork_1.12.0-beta.8_testnet_goleveldb_amd64.deb\"\r\n\r\n# re-apply any systemd unit file customizations\r\n\r\n# Restart the node\r\nsudo systemctl restart secret-node\r\n```\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Update v1.11 proposal by @liorbond in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1539\r\n* Hardcoded admins will fit every chain by @liorbond in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1542\r\n* Fix PFM drops IBC contracts packets (v1.12) by @assafmo in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1550\r\n* Fix migration code for hardcoded admins (v1.12) by @assafmo in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1548\r\n* Bump sha2 from 0.10.7 to 0.10.8 in /cosmwasm by @dependabot in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1549\r\n* Hardcode last admins by @eshelB in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1551\r\n* Testing Admin in init by @eshelB in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1553\r\n* Bump github.com/cosmos/ibc-go/v4 from 4.4.2 to 4.5.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1554\r\n* Add admin to WasmMsg::Instantiate in cosmwasm-std (v1.12)  by @assafmo in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1552\r\n* Rebuild Swagger UI for v1.12 by @assafmo in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1556\r\n* Update PFM to stop dropping packets of IBC contracts (v1.12) by @assafmo in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1555\r\n* Add progress prints for v1.12 store migration by @assafmo in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1557\r\n* Bump golang.org/x/crypto from 0.13.0 to 0.14.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1558\r\n* Bump github.com/spf13/viper from 1.14.0 to 1.17.0 by @dependabot in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1560\r\n* Prepare v1.12 upgrade by @assafmo in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1561\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/compare/v1.11.0-beta.18...v1.12.0-beta.8","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/124286742/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":4},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/122417095","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/122417095/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/122417095/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/tag/v1.11.0-beta.18","id":122417095,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bb