ttps://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":43751148,"digest":null,"download_count":18,"created_at":"2023-01-30T18:14:35Z","updated_at":"2023-03-26T10:58:47Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.7.0-rc.2/secretnetwork_1.7.0-rc.2_testnet_rocksdb_amd64.deb-TO_DELETE-DO_NOT_USE.deb"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/assets/101008224","id":101008224,"node_id":"RA_kwDODh_DHs4GBUNg","name":"secretnetwork_1.7.0-rocksdb-testnet-patch.2_amd64.deb","label":null,"uploader":{"login":"Cashmaney","id":16579705,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTc5NzA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16579705?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cashmaney","html_url":"https://github.com/Cashmaney","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cashmaney/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cashmaney/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cashmaney/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cashmaney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cashmaney/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cashmaney/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cashmaney/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cashmaney/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cashmaney/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":43749744,"digest":null,"download_count":4,"created_at":"2023-03-26T10:44:55Z","updated_at":"2023-03-26T10:45:03Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.7.0-rc.2/secretnetwork_1.7.0-rocksdb-testnet-patch.2_amd64.deb"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/tarball/v1.7.0-rc.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/zipball/v1.7.0-rc.2","body":"# :warning: TESTNET :warning:\r\n\r\n## Upgrade instructions\r\n\r\nCheck what database type you're currently using:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nawk -F \\\" '/^db_backend =/{print $2}' ~/.secretd/config/config.toml\r\n```\r\n\r\nUncomment and download the right binary based on your database type:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Stop the v1.6.0 node\r\nsudo systemctl stop secret-node\r\n\r\n# Get & verify secretd v1.7.0\r\n\r\n## goleveldb\r\n# wget \"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.7.0-rc.2/secretnetwork_1.7.0-rc.2_testnet_goleveldb_amd64.deb\"\r\n# echo \"9c6266f3e4bf0cac968e6a999ee5f7e7c7294c59f8fbbb7aa7237b468b0d72ad secretnetwork_1.7.0-rc.2_testnet_goleveldb_amd64.deb\" | sha256sum --check\r\n\r\n## rocksdb\r\n# wget \"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.7.0-rc.2/secretnetwork_1.7.0-rc.2_testnet_rocksdb_amd64.deb\"\r\n# echo \"9c6266f3e4bf0cac968e6a999ee5f7e7c7294c59f8fbbb7aa7237b468b0d72ad secretnetwork_1.7.0-rc.2_testnet_rocksdb_amd64.deb\" | sha256sum --check\r\n\r\n# Install 1.7.0 binaries\r\nsudo apt install -y ./secretnetwork_1.7.0-rc.2_testnet_*_amd64.deb\r\n\r\n# Restart the node\r\nsudo systemctl restart secret-node\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Mandatory secret.js update (non-API breaking)\r\nThe tx encryption key format has changed, requiring an update of secret.js:\r\n- `v1.5.x`, `v1.6.x` -> `v1.7.1-beta.2` (Recommended)\r\n- `v1.4.x` -> `v1.4.6`\r\n- `v0.17.8` - can still be used\r\n\r\n## Update\r\nUbuntu 18.04 is no longer supported \r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Fixed OSX Ledger disconnection issues in secretcli\r\n* Fixed an issue when sending multiple message types in the same tx\r\n* Fixed `/cosmos/base/node/v1beta1/config` \r\n* Added expedited gov proposals\r\n* Added the ability to rotate consensus seed during a network upgrade\r\n* Added a feature for auto-restake of staking rewards"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/89913816","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/89913816/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/89913816/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/tag/v1.7.0-rc.1","id":89913816,"author":{"login":"liorbond","id":22855163,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODU1MTYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22855163?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/liorbond","html_url":"https://github.com/liorbond","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liorbond/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liorbond/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liorbond/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liorbond/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liorbond/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liorbond/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liorbond/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liorbond/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liorbond/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODh_DHs4FW_nY","tag_name":"v1.7.0-rc.1","target_commitish":"master","name":"v1.7.0-rc.1","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":true,"created_at":"2023-01-23T16:40:52Z","updated_at":"2023-01-24T10:39:49Z","published_at":"2023-01-23T16:43:06Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/assets/92752431","id":92752431,"node_id":"RA_kwDODh_DHs4Fh0ov