-O(1) queries by @assafmo in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1163\r\n* Fix & test v0.10 `env.block.time` by @assafmo in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1162\r\n* Fix & test init data output by @liorbond in https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/pull/1164\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/compare/v1.4.0-beta.5...v1.4.0-beta.6","mentions_count":4},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/76630107","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/76630107/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/76630107/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/tag/v1.4.1-beta.2","id":76630107,"author":{"login":"assafmo","id":22766533,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzY2NTMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22766533?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo","html_url":"https://github.com/assafmo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODh_DHs4EkUhb","tag_name":"v1.4.1-beta.2","target_commitish":"master","name":"v1.4.1-beta.2","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":true,"created_at":"2022-09-08T14:50:18Z","updated_at":"2022-09-08T18:48:24Z","published_at":"2022-09-08T18:43:03Z","as