epos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/vnd.debian.binary-package","state":"uploaded","size":41979556,"digest":null,"download_count":10,"created_at":"2022-09-08T18:33:59Z","updated_at":"2022-09-08T18:34:23Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.4.1-beta.2/secretnetwork_1.4.1-beta.2_testnet_rocksdb_amd64.deb"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/tarball/v1.4.1-beta.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/zipball/v1.4.1-beta.2","body":"# Shockwave Delta (Testnet) followup optional upgrade\r\n\r\n## Upgrading from v1.4.0-beta.5\r\n\r\nCheck what database type you're currently using:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nawk -F \\\" '/^db_backend =/{print $2}' ~/.secretd/config/config.toml\r\n```\r\n\r\nUncomment and download the right binary based on your database type:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Stop the v1.4.0 node\r\nsudo systemctl stop secret-node\r\n\r\n# Get & verify secretd v1.4.1\r\n\r\n## goleveldb\r\n# wget \"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.4.1-beta.2/secretnetwork_1.4.1-beta.2_testnet_goleveldb_amd64.deb\"\r\n# echo \"d7549691651dde2bcdcd6d554831e6ec23e76126ebe07aa3e18b1897380a11b9 secretnetwork_1.4.1-beta.2_testnet_goleveldb_amd64.deb\" | sha256sum --check\r\n\r\n## rocksdb\r\n# wget \"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/download/v1.4.1-beta.2/secretnetwork_1.4.1-beta.2_testnet_rocksdb_amd64.deb\"\r\n# echo \"972e77d4c3f3bd10c2936120bffa417f22de7c055d1a2cb595ec1782fe843db2 secretnetwork_1.4.1-beta.2_testnet_rocksdb_amd64.deb\" | sha256sum --check\r\n\r\n# Install v1.4.1 binaries\r\nsudo apt install -y ./secretnetwork_1.4.1-beta.2_testnet_*_amd64.deb\r\n\r\n# Restart the node\r\nsudo systemctl restart secret-node\r\n```\r\n\r\nNote: Upgrading can take 2-3 hours, but afterwards node performance should drastically improve compared to v1.4.0.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n\r\n- Upgrade Cosmos SDK to v0.45.8\r\n- Upgrade Tendermint to v0.34.21\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/compare/v1.4.0-beta.5...v1.4.1-beta.2\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/76581742","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/76581742/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/76581742/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/tag/v1.4.0-beta.5","id":76581742,"author":{"login":"assafmo","id":22766533,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzY2NTMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22766533?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo","html_url":"https://github.com/assafmo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/assafmo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDODh_DHs4EkItu","tag_name":"v1.4.0-beta.5","target_commitish":"master","name":"v1.4.0-beta.5","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":true,"created_at":"2022-09-08T11:00:01Z","updated_at":"2022-09-08T18:30:29Z","published_at":"2022-09-08T11:03:59Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtl