abs/SecretNetwork/tarball/v1.3.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/zipball/v1.3.0","body":"# Shockwave Alpha\r\n\r\nThe v1.3.0 software upgrade is set for block **3,343,000**, which is estimated to occur on **Wednesday, 11 May 2022 at 1:00PM UTC**. You can monitor the ETA at https://www.mintscan.io/secret/blocks/3343000.\r\n\r\n## Upgrade Instructions\r\n\r\nhttps://docs.scrt.network/secret-network-documentation/post-mortems-upgrades/upgrade-instructions/shockwave-delta\r\n\r\n## Highlights\r\n\r\nThis upgrade adds the following features:\r\n\r\n- CosmWasm v1\r\n- Bump WASM gas costs\r\n    - Base WASM invocation from 10k to 100k\r\n    - WASM chain access 2k per access\r\n- Add support for EIP191 signatures (MetaMask compatible data)\r\n- Ledger support for Authz & Feegrant\r\n- Revert Chain of Secrets tombstone state and restore slashed funds to all delegators\r\n- Upgrade the ibc-go module to v3.3.0:\r\n  - Full changelog: [`ibc-go/v3.0.0...v3.3.0`](https://github.com/cosmos/ibc-go/compare/v3.0.0...v3.3.0)\r\n\r\nv1.4.0 changelog: [CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#140)\r\n\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/66403933/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/60562267","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/60562267/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/60562267/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/scrtlabs/SecretNetwork/releases/tag/v1.2.5","id":60562267,"author":{"login":"Cashmaney","id":16579705,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTc5NzA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16579705?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cashmaney","html_url":"https://github.com/Cashmaney"